- Initial limit: Higher initial credit limit may indicate bank’s trust, correlating with higher credit score.
- BIRTHDATE (Age): Older clients might have more stable credit history; younger clients might have less credit history or higher risk.
- SEX: Gender generally has no direct causal effect on credit score.
