- LV_SETTLEMENTNAME: Similar to LV_AREA, might reflect socioeconomic factors.
- INDUSTRYNAME: Certain industries might have more stable income or job security, influencing credit score.
- PDN (Probability of default number): Higher PDN directly correlates with lower credit score.
- UNDERAGECHILDRENCOUNT: More dependents might increase financial burden, possibly lowering credit score.
- FAMILYSTATUS: Marital status might affect financial stability; married clients may have higher credit score.

